  "note": "The three verb indexes share their sixteen tokens. The noun and verb also overlap in spelling. Job 7:5 alone uses the word of skin, and the exact change is uncertain. Lane’s Arabic رجع is to return. Its relationship to the Hebrew senses of rest, suddenness and the moving sea is uncertain."
